  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0:\n- ADDED: generated clients for the Vouchsafe API v1 and v2 (risk), with Task/Result calls in Api for every operation\n- ADDED: token cache shared by both versions; renews five minutes before expiry, one fetch for concurrent callers, one retry on 401\n- ADDED: multipart supporting document, photo ID and risk check calls with named, typed files; PhotoId and RiskCheck inputs checked before sending\n- ADDED: VerificationSummary: status and outcome per step and enrichment\n- ADDED: VouchsafeClient.As to read union-typed fields as a member type\n- ADDED: Webhook.parse for verification and alert deliveries, tokenMatches, confirmAsync\n- ADDED: path parameters escaped as one segment; endpoints get a trailing slash; credentials and tokens print without secrets\n- ADDED: bundled spec edited for SwaggerProvider 4.2.1: two reference name clashes",
